{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling: NF-5 takes the gate slot now. C1 waits only for its review.\n\nC1's gate passed at 37be4a36, tree 84d975fd. Main bc79b6aa is an\nancestor of that head, so the landing gives main the same tree.\n\n1. NF-5 merges 37be4a36 now, not bc79b6aa. Its head then holds R1 and\n   C1, and the gate of that head stays valid after C1 lands.\n2. NF-5 then runs its owed checks in this order: the reproduction with\n   the identifier refresh for Counter and Lending, the Grow line, the\n   Voice intervals C and Q, then the full gate.\n3. The NF-5 act that reports the reproduction names the Grow\n   identifiers. Equal identifiers let the planner sign Grow as soon as\n   C1 is on main.\n4. When the checker asks for a change to C1, NF-5 merges the repaired C1\n   head and runs its gate again. The planner accepts that cost.\n\nC1 files its review request beside this work. A review reads files and\nruns nothing, so it needs no slot. The planner sends the landing\ndecision when the approval arrives.\n\nThe planner runs no compile, test, signing or deployment before the\nNF-5 END act, except the C1 landing.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:de01b2a8b7d624df3187134cae40e34dce04efc9 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:003802bea882e6c5c61885187bad460807f9b07f, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:01af183f1fd462ece996760281d760bfe03a427c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0494d214d1779ad41e6408903f743dc98d35c57c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:04e73625fd8bfed4b211546238ef7a71b1ad34f9 and 151 more","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}